Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PVMFX-X4t_vDAR511R8qFQ","review_id":"mXmlauVAjWhwYep8zH2YNg","date":"2020-06-10T23:59:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9388382434844971,"text_excerpt":"It was my first time really venturing out into *the world* when I decided to stop into St. Roch Market for lunch. I was relieved to see that they were asking customers to \"mask up\", so I put on my cute homemade mask and decided to see what I was in the mood for. Selection was limited, but I was delighted to see Laksa NOLA was open serving tasty Burmese food. Looking over the menu, I knew I wanted noodles and spring rolls. I got the Laksa Bowl with chicken and it was basically a ramen-like bowl packed with an egg, tofu, bean sprouts all swirling around in delicious broth. They also give you a special sauce on the side, if you're looking for some kick. The spring rolls are shrimp spring rol..."},{"business_id":"PVMFX-X4t_vDAR511R8qFQ","review_id":"3rLOuS9jiDxRzYdeXtwZUg","date":"2019-06-15T12:08:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9269928932189941,"text_excerpt":"Great new addition to the St. Roch market serving Malaysian and Burmese food. Being a total virgin to Malaysian and Burmese cuisine I looked for something familiar and settled on the Shrimp Eggrolls and Laksa Bowl with Chicken. The eggrolls were delicious, served steaming hot and packed with shrimp and the three dipping sauces are a fun way to expand the flavor profiles of the dish. For my Laksa Bowl I selected the egg noodles and level 2 spicy level. The Bowl come out hot and the broth was a great blend of flavors with a wonderful aroma that made each spoon fill a burst of flavors. The chicken that accompanied the noodles was also good but I wish it had been sliced and placed in the bowl..."},{"business_id":"PVMFX-X4t_vDAR511R8qFQ","review_id":"TjIv5NKhdx6O7s0SLMJnpA","date":"2020-10-17T00:44:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9268311262130737,"text_excerpt":"We ordered dinner to go from here tonight, our first time in St. Roch market since the \"rona\" shut things down. While it was sad to see a few empty stalls, it was great to taste some yummy food. I got the noodle dish with 2/3 on the spicy factor. 3 words to describe it - de. lish. us! I'll definitely get that again. My partner ordered the soup. It was also delicious and a unique flavor combo. I hope they do well over the next months, we'll do our part to support."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PVMFX-X4t_vDAR511R8qFQ","photo_id":"_zNHbmNkmtEw4M1Gha4elQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/_zNHbmNkmtEw4M1Gha4elQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8801683187484741},{"business_id":"PVMFX-X4t_vDAR511R8qFQ","photo_id":"eA_e4L5RW0jnBBhmZAEFbg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eA_e4L5RW0jnBBhmZAEFbg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8404914140701294},{"business_id":"PVMFX-X4t_vDAR511R8qFQ","photo_id":"i6FePk0a_4mFFvRXozJ4iw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/i6FePk0a_4mFFvRXozJ4iw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8019934892654419},{"business_id":"PVMFX-X4t_vDAR511R8qFQ","photo_id":"1N7QHSH7mplwl0ajcLfaZw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1N7QHSH7mplwl0ajcLfaZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7872236967086792},{"business_id":"PVMFX-X4t_vDAR511R8qFQ","photo_id":"M7ddkTqjocUj5VQj51qjrQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/M7ddkTqjocUj5VQj51qjrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7845192551612854}]},"notebook_case":null}
